MagicDesk builds the emulator locally without the upstream PTY/session and JNI
implementation; its client interface is limited to emulator callbacks.
Unknown SGR codes use locale-independent diagnostic formatting.
MagicDesk extends the parser and buffer metadata for OSC 8 hyperlinks,
OSC 9 notifications/progress and OSC 133 command boundaries. These changes and
their focused regression tests are maintained in the local module.
